#: ../../quick-reference.rst:1
msgid "Part XI: Quick Reference Card"
msgstr "Parte XI: Tarjeta de referencia rápida"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:4
msgid ""
"Keep beside a terminal: build, run, configure, route, observe, and "
"diagnose. Part X holds the full tables; this card holds what an operator "
"types."
msgstr ""
"Para tener junto al terminal: compilar, ejecutar, configurar, enrutar, "
"observar y diagnosticar. La parte X contiene las tablas completas; esta "
"tarjeta contiene lo que teclea un operador."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:6
msgid "Build"
msgstr "Compilar"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:9
msgid ""
"cargo build --release -p sibuna                          # daemon + "
"SQLite + console\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --no-default-features    # in-memory, no "
"external crate\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --features postgres-tls  # shared "
"PostgreSQL clusters\n"
"rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # or set SIBUNA_POW_WASM / "
"SIBUNA_CONSOLE_WASM\n"
"cargo test            # unit, live daemon, storage and console tests\n"
"cargo clippy --all-targets && cargo fmt --check\n"
"cargo xtask check     # 70-line / 1,408-line / 99-column gate\n"
"cargo xtask browser   # headless Chromium checks\n"
"cargo xtask bench product   # whole products under wrk -> "
"benchmarks/results/\n"
"guidedog build        # this book (guidedog dsc: the SID records)"
msgstr ""
"cargo build --release -p sibuna                          # daemon + "
"SQLite + consola\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --no-default-features    # en memoria, "
"sin crates externos\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --features postgres-tls  # clúster con "
"PostgreSQL común\n"
"rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # o define SIBUNA_POW_WASM / "
"SIBUNA_CONSOLE_WASM\n"
"cargo test            # unitarias, daemon en ejecución, almacenamiento y "
"consola\n"
"cargo clippy --all-targets && cargo fmt --check\n"
"cargo xtask check     # límites de 70 líneas / 1.408 líneas / 99 "
"columnas\n"
"cargo xtask browser   # comprobaciones en Chromium sin interfaz gráfica\n"
"cargo xtask bench product   # productos completos bajo wrk -> "
"benchmarks/results/\n"
"guidedog build        # este libro (guidedog dsc: los registros SID)"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:22
msgid "Run"
msgstr "Ejecutar"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:25
msgid ""
"# Shield (default): PoW + WAF, proxy to :3000\n"
"sibuna -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Gate: PoW only\n"
"sibuna --gate -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Forward auth behind Nginx/Caddy (trusts X-Forwarded-For)\n"
"sibuna -m forward_auth --host 127.0.0.1 -p 8080 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Edge: persistent policies, reputation, forensics in <dir>/sibuna.db\n"
"sibuna -D /var/lib/sibuna -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# JA4 from a trusted ingress (Cloudflare's header; nginx module: x-ja4; "
"ATS: ja4)\n"
"sibuna --ja4-header cf-ja4 --trust-forwarded -p 8080 -u 3000 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Cluster member: shared PostgreSQL, unique node id\n"
"sibuna --database-url-file /etc/sibuna/database-url --cluster-node 1 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret"
msgstr ""
"# Shield (por defecto): PoW + WAF, proxy hacia :3000\n"
"sibuna -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Gate: solo PoW\n"
"sibuna --gate -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Forward-auth detrás de Nginx/Caddy (confía en X-Forwarded-For)\n"
"sibuna -m forward_auth --host 127.0.0.1 -p 8080 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Edge: políticas, reputación e incidentes persistentes en "
"<dir>/sibuna.db\n"
"sibuna -D /var/lib/sibuna -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# JA4 del proxy de entrada fiable (Cloudflare; módulo nginx: x-ja4; ATS: "
"ja4)\n"
"sibuna --ja4-header cf-ja4 --trust-forwarded -p 8080 -u 3000 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Miembro de un clúster: PostgreSQL compartido, id de nodo único\n"
"sibuna --database-url-file /etc/sibuna/database-url --cluster-node 1 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:41
msgid "Console (opt-in preview)"
msgstr "Consola (versión preliminar opcional)"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:44
msgid ""
"# Initialize while the daemon is stopped, then start the console\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"
msgstr ""
"# Inicializa con el daemon detenido y después arranca la consola\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:50
msgid ""
"Open ``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` and replace the temporary "
"password. Add ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` to place the node on "
"the globe. Remote access requires an HTTPS proxy, an explicit origin and "
"trusted-proxy CIDRs; follow Part IX. SID 0007 is Committed. The console "
"passes its browser workflows in headless Chromium (SID 0010, criterion "
"5); its formal performance isolation gate remains open (Part VIII)."
msgstr ""
"Abre ``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` y sustituye la contraseña "
"temporal. Añade ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` para situar el "
"nodo en el globo. El acceso remoto requiere un proxy HTTPS, un origen "
"explícito y los CIDR de los proxies de confianza; sigue la parte IX. SID "
"0007 está en estado Committed. La consola supera sus flujos de trabajo de "
"navegador en Chromium sin interfaz gráfica (SID 0010, criterio 5); su "
"criterio formal de aislamiento del rendimiento sigue abierto (parte VIII)."

